# Feature specifications

The [harness specification](00-harness.md) defines project-wide constraints.
Copy [feature-template.md](feature-template.md) to create a feature spec;
keep the template itself unchanged. Direct user requests can also define work.
See [example-crud.md](example-crud.md) for a complete illustrative spec.
The example is not a requirement for this project and must not be implemented
unless explicitly requested.

Describe observable behavior, edge cases and testable acceptance criteria.
An entity-relationship diagram, including Mermaid, describes structure but
does not determine API behavior, persistence, authorization or deletion rules.
State those decisions explicitly or ask the user before implementing them.
